  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Streamlined Canonball**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Senor**: back after 86 archived shows (444 days) [4]\n- **Back Up & Push**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Froggy Went A-Courtin'**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Jeff Sturgeon**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Dust & Regret**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Fiddling Around**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-07-23** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 29 songs; 142 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2023-07-23.me40.flac24**: source not stated; 29 songs; 144 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Set I [1]\n- Mics were placed at the front left corner of the soundboard, ten feet high, on a PAS setup [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-07-23**: taped by Mike D (VT); source: AKG 460 (Modified by Jim Williams) ck/61 (ORTF @ 11’) @ front/left corner of sbd cage > Kind Kables Big Green Fatties > Sound Devices MixPre6 (1st gen.) @… [1]\n- **billystrings2023-07-23.me40.flac24**: taped by Brett S; source: Sennheiser K3U/ME40> Movo WST 100 Windscreens> Canare XLR's> Oade Concert Mod R-44 (24Bit/48khz) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo/) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo/) [6]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo/) [8]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - Burlington, VT - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo-burlington-vt/) [9]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Midway Lawn at Champlain Valley Expo - Burlington, VT - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/midway-lawn-at-champlain-valley-expo-burlington-vt/) [10]",
